ereliastudio-sparkle installs Sparkle Core by default:

    find_package(sparkle CONFIG REQUIRED COMPONENTS Core)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE sparkle::core)

Enable the graphics feature for the full graphical Sparkle library:

    find_package(sparkle CONFIG REQUIRED COMPONENTS Core Graphics)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE sparkle::sparkle)

The optional test-library feature also enables graphics and provides reusable test utilities:

    find_package(sparkle CONFIG REQUIRED COMPONENTS Core Graphics TestLibrary)
    target_link_libraries(tests PRIVATE Sparkle::TestLibrary)
